sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Klien (dosen01)
    participant G as Gateway (PEP)
    participant PE as Policy Engine
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant A as AuditService

    C->>G: POST /auth/login<br/>X-Device-ID + username/password
    G->>DB: zt_gateway: SELECT users, devices
    Note over G: bcrypt compare + cek device terdaftar<br/>+ user aktif
    alt device asing / tidak aktif
        G-->>C: 403 DEVICE_NOT_REGISTERED / USER_INACTIVE
        G->>A: catat deny (reason)
    else sukses
        G->>DB: INSERT refresh_tokens (hash SHA-256, expires)
        Note over G: tanda tangan RS256 dengan private key<br/>(private key tidak pernah keluar gateway)
        G-->>C: 200 access (10 mnt) + refresh (rotasi)
        G->>A: catat allow LOGIN_OK
    end
    A->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (tepat 1 baris)
